"value":1,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5220880","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-2583700-1846651706691820","game_id":"steam-2583700","kind":"announcement","title":"Lucky Dog Rise at Steam Next Fest: Earn a Mystery 2026 Cosmetic!","summary":"Lucky Dog Rise is joining Steam Next Fest!If you've ever wanted a dog on your desktop, Lucky Dog has a mystery welcome gift waiting for you.Complete the celebration and take home a keepsake from 2026We've put together a special demo celebration for Steam Next Fest. Complete the demo's collection event to claim a special 2026 commemorative cosmetic.It bears a little reminder of this year, with a surprise that sets it apart from everyday outfits. We'll keep its look a secret for now, so you can di","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:32:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691820","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2583700-1844751498222880","game_id":"steam-2583700","kind":"announcement","title":"Lucky Dog Rise Demo is Out Now!","summary":"Lucky Dog Rise Demo is Out Now! We’re very happy to finally say it: the Lucky Dog Rise Demo is officially out now! We’ve carefully prepared and adjusted the content for this demo, and we hope that even as a demo, it still offers a complete, relaxing, and enjoyable experience. We also deliberately chose the Mid-Autumn Festival as the release day for the Demo. The Mid-Autumn Festival is a traditional holiday centered around reunion and spending time together. We hope that on a day like this, a lit","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T23:01:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498222880","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2583700-1842846814447101","game_id":"steam-2583700","kind":"announcement","title":"Lucky Dog Rise Demo Coming in September — and We’re Aiming for Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Over the past little while, we’ve been inviting groups of players to try Lucky Dog Rise through our Playtest, and we’ve received a lot of helpful feedback along the way.Now, our little dog is getting ready for the next stage.We plan to release a public Demo for Lucky Dog Rise by September 25. Unlike the current Playtest, which is opened to players in batches, the Demo will be available to everyone once it goes live.So if you previously applied for the Playtest but haven’t received access yet, do","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T16:09:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814447101","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2583700-1842212951298081","game_id":"steam-2583700","kind":"announcement","title":"Happy International Dog Day!","summary":"A few Lucky Dogs dressed up for the occasion, so we thought we’d let them all come out and celebrate together.Lucky Dog Rise is currently in public Playtest on Steam, and we’re still adding more hats, outfits, and little details as the game grows.If you’d like a small dog buddy keeping you company on your desktop, you’re always welcome to join the Playtest.Hope every dog gets a little extra love today. ♥","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T20:22:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951298081","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2583700-1841579228671046","game_id":"steam-2583700","kind":"announcement","title":"Lucky Dog Rise Playtest — Testers Wanted!","summary":"First of all, thank you for joining us and helping our little dog grow! We’re currently looking for testers to join the Lucky Dog Rise Playtest. If you enjoy desktop pets, collecting cosmetics, or simply want a little dog to keep you company while you work, study, or relax, we’d love to have you join us. You can now request access to the Playtest directly from the Steam store page.About Playtest AccessWe’ve received quite a few Playtest applications, so access will be opened in batches, with new","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-22T09:01:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228671046","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:22:59Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2583700":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:30Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:30Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2583700":"2026-10-26T09:54:30Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2583700":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:30Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:30Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:30Z"},"5220880":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:30Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:30Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:54:30Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-2583700","app_id":2583700,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:09Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"96e45f2603c98c258c77d104ee092ef8251c8cbaebec8d5e8f4d58bf34f6af9b","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"행운을 가져다주는 강아지를 화면에 데려오세요! 한구석에서 일과 휴식, 게임을 함께해요. 지치면 카드 한 판 어때요? 손에 든 패뿐 아니라 강아지의 표정도 살펴보세요. 어쩌면 행운이 숨어 있을지도 몰라요. 깜짝 상자를 열고 의상을 모아 둘만의 행운 가득한 보금자리를 꾸며 보세요!","publishers":[{"name":"Seanan Studio","creator_clan_account_id":46583669}],"developers":[{"name":"Seanan Studio","creator_clan_account_id":46583669}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1798704000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_quarter"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Official Gameplay Trailer V1","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1790631294","trailer_category":2,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"2583700/295817582/838b68c2a0a7b83adcc02ac76bb7f0c27b236b39/1790630777/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"2583700/295817582/838b68c2a0a7b83adcc02ac76bb7f0c27b236b39/1790630777/microtrailer.mp4","type":"video/mp4"}],"adaptive_trailers":[{"cdn_path":"2583700/295817582/838b68c2a0a7b83adcc02ac76bb7f0c27b236b39/1790630777/dash_av1.mpd","encoding":"dash_av1"},{"cdn_path":"2583700/295817582/838b68c2a0a7b83adcc02ac76bb7f0c27b236b39/1790630777/dash_h264.mpd","encoding":"dash_h264"},{"cdn_path":"2583700/295817582/838b68c2a0a7b83adcc02ac76bb7f0c27b236b39/1790630777/hls_264_master.m3u8","encoding":"hls_h264"}],"screenshot_medium":"257437487/a16c79a7bb6e24d2ce9b0f637b3961ad00fe7c42/movie_600x337.jpg","screenshot_full":"257437487/a16c79a7bb6e24d2ce9b0f637b3961ad00fe7c42/movie_full.jpg","trailer_base_id":1348148,"all_ages":true},{"trailer_name":"Thanks for Playing - Music Video","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1792790077","trailer_category":3,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"2583700/1933718362/b3471a8757713cbb35641afd860aa3420e1741c7/1792788580/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"2583700/1933718362/b3471a8757713cbb35641afd860aa3420e1741c7/1792788580/microtrailer.mp4","type":"video/mp4"}],"adaptive_trailers":[{"cdn_path":"2583700/1933718362/b3471a8757713cbb35641afd860aa3420e1741c7/1792788580/dash_av1.mpd","encoding":"d